{"resourceIdentifier":"4430","resourceName":"Reflorestamento de Impacto no Brasil Project","description":"Investancia Brasil Ltda  (Investancia) is undertaking a Verified Carbon Standard (VCS) grouped reforestation project, known as Reflorestamento de Impacto no Brasil Project. The Project is planting pongamia (Pongamia pinnata) and other tree species in degraded pastures across Mato Grosso do Sul, Brazil in areas that were cleared of native forests more than ten years prior to the projects’ start date. \r\nInvestancia is developing a business model to establish pongamia as a regional commodity in a region where agriculture, other than cattle-ranching, is extremely difficult to make work. The focus of Investancia’s business is four-fold:\r\n\r\n1) Production of reforestation oil;\r\n2) Maintaining cattle or hay on silvopastoral lands with improved pastures;\r\n3) Providing protein (i.e., feed) for cattle from the pongamia seedcake; and\r\n4) Sequestering carbon dioxide in the pongamia trees (i.e., generate carbon offset credits).\r\n\r\nTo date, Investancia has established a nursery, explored the suitability of pongamia in the region, developed protocols, assessed various genetic strains of pongamia, and spoken with numerous local landowners about leasing land. The Reflorestamento de Impacto no Brasil Project will sequester carbon dioxide and generate GHG emission removals in the planted pongamia trees and in the soil following the reforestation of degraded pasture.","location":{"latitude":-21.596894,"longitude":-57.819096},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-08-28","endExclusive":"2023-09-28","endInclusive":"2023-09-27"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4430"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Mato Grosso do Sul"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"239"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-ACM0003"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"44 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AENOR CONFIA, S.A. (UNIPERSONAL)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"09/01/2025"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/01/2023 - 31/12/2062"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=93413&IDKEY=n0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9d128816527","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PROJ_DESC_DRAFT_4430_28APR2023.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-07-05T14:11:23.06Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=96201&IDKEY=0lksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098o132661179","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PROJ_DESC_PCP_4430_06JUL2023.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-08-28T14:26:19.33Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=90131&IDKEY=siofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq3m124290649","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS-Listing-Representation-Single-Representor-v4.1 (1) - Investancia Brasil Ltda signed.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-05-15T12:53:44.57Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=93468&IDKEY=j0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9f128892372","do